<title>GERMANY: Thyssen studying possible capital rise.</title>
<headline>Thyssen studying possible capital rise.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified German steel group Thyssen AG said on Wednesday it was studying the possibility of a capital increase.</p>
<p>Current shareholders would be excluded from the offer, which would be part of the company's portfolio restructuring, said the company, which is in the process of merging its steel operations with Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp.</p>
<p>The supervisory board will consider the matter in its July 17 session, it said. No figures were given.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
